# Sausage And Mushroom Penne Pasta

Based on [http://www.budgetbytes.com/2014/…](http://www.budgetbytes.com/2014/04/one-pot-sausage-mushroom-pasta) ([wayback](http://web.archive.org/web/20170927022449/https://www.budgetbytes.com/2014/04/one-pot-sausage-mushroom-pasta/))

{ rating="3" image="sausage_and_mushroom_penne_pasta.jpg" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

- [ ] 3-6 [links Italian sausage]{ ing="links-italian-sausage" }, baked and sliced into rounds
- [ ] 1 [red onion]{ ing="red-onion" }, diced
- [ ] 8 oz container of [button mushrooms]{ ing="button-mushrooms" }
- [ ] 28 oz can of [crushed tomatoes]{ ing="crushed-tomatoes" }
- [ ] 3 cloves of [garlic]{ ing="garlic" }
- [ ] 1 tsp [basil]{ ing="basil" }
- [ ] 1 tsp [oregano]{ ing="oregano" }
- [ ] 1 lb box of [penne]{ ing="penne" }
- [ ] [Shredded parmesan]{ ing="shredded-parmesan" }, for serving

## Recipe

1. See the [Oven Baked Sausage](../main/oven_baked_sausage.html). When finished, cut into rounds
1. In parallel, dice and prep the [garlic]{ ing="garlic" }, [onions]{ ing="red-onion" }, and [mushrooms]{ ing="button-mushrooms" }
1. Combine half of the diced [tomatoes]{ ing="crushed-tomatoes" }, the [sausage]{ ing="links-italian-sausage" }, diced items, and the box of [penne]{ ing="penne" } pasta. Mix in the [basil]{ ing="basil" }, [oregano]{ ing="oregano" }, and garlic
1. Add the rest of the diced tomatoes and 2.5-3 cups of water, then bring the pot to a rapid boil
1. Once boiling, stir and simmer at 30% heat with a tight fitting lid. Make sure the pasta is submerged

   1. Simmer for 10 minutes, stir, then remove the lid and simmer for an additional 5-10 minutes
